# DemoUi — the 134 demo's UI resource, its persisted state and the UI action
# dispatch (#918 split of Main for the 1000-line cap): createDemoUiResource,
# the 134 state record (serialize / restore across hot reloads) and
# dispatchUiActions. The chrome itself is lib/app3d/EditorPanel; Main keeps
# the frame loop.
